50:Find the entrance to the underground.
51:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: These mirrors represent... Me?? Why am I wearing different clothes? That one represents Truth... Why did those warriors disappear?
52:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: This is another trap. The mirrors transport me not only to another place, but also to another time.

53:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: What happened??
54:Stranger: (rings a bell) Everyone to the top of the mountain!!
55:Stranger: And why are you standing there? Quickly! Run towards the mountain.
56:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: Why? What's happening? (the talisman began to beep)
57:Stranger: A huge wave is coming!

58:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: The talisman has turned off. It must be here.

59:[$FFB1B9]Tyrio[$ffffff]: Dad??
60:[$FFB1B9]King Dyron[$ffffff]: Tyrio? Where am I?
61:[$FFB1B9]Tyrio[$ffffff]: n Ewerin. We're going to Andaro. What's this about? How did you get here?
62:[$FFB1B9]King Dyron[$ffffff]: It's a long story. I don't have much time. Listen. Hold on as long as you can. I'm going for Truth's armor and I'm getting closer. I'll help you, just hold on. 
63:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: Where have I been teleported to now?

64:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: What's your name?
65:[$2CB21A]Stranger[$ffffff]: I'm just a squire.
66:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: I need your name quickly.
67:[$2CB21A]Stranger[$ffffff]: Teriop.
68:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: Listen. Teriop. Beware of Groton. Stop him...

69:Find Truth's armor and axes
70:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: Finally... Here it is.
71:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: Prepare yourself, Kregor. I'm coming.
72:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: What a frost... What a place... Uninhabitable...
73:[$FFB1B9]Dyron from Another Time[$ffffff]: What is this??